.TH batten-ready 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-ready \- Whether an issue\*(Aqs Ready block satisfies the checkable clauses of the gate
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten ready\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Whether an issue\*(Aqs Ready block satisfies the checkable clauses of the gate
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
batten\-ready\-lint(1)
Refuse an issue whose Ready block fails a checkable clause of the Definition of Ready
.TP
batten\-ready\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
